  "label": "Disney Character Stereotype",
  "description": "The meme relies on the real-world stereotype that Disney characters are iconic, timeless, and often used as symbols of childhood innocence or nostalgia. This stereotype is part of broader cultural phenomena around media franchises and their influence on public perception. The meme uses this to create a humorous or ironic contrast with the child, who is also being framed as 'classic' or 'authentic'.",
